                        "description": "**⚙️ Business Settings - Home Screen Configuration**\n\nReturns home screen configuration including:\n- Section visibility flags (categories, banners, stores, etc.)\n- Home screen layout settings\n- Feature toggles\n\n**Headers:**\n- `X-localization`: Language (ar or en)\n\n**Response includes:**\n- `categories_section`: Show/hide categories\n- `banners_section`: Show/hide banners\n- `popular_stores_section`: Show/hide popular stores\n- `brand_section`: Show/hide brands (Ecommerce)\n- Other home screen settings"
