                        "description": "**📦 Available Modules List**\n\nReturns list of all available modules:\n- Module 3: Ecommerce\n- Module 6: Food/Restaurant\n- Module 7: Grocery\n- Module 8: Pharmacy\n\n**Headers:**\n- `zoneId`: Zone ID array (optional - filters modules by zone)\n- `X-localization`: Language (ar or en)\n\n**Response includes:**\n- Module ID\n- Module name\n- Module type\n- Module icon\n- Module status\n- Zone availability"
