                        "description": "**📍 Get Zone ID from Location**\n\nDetects user's zone based on latitude and longitude coordinates.\n\n**Query Parameters (Required):**\n- `latitude`: User latitude\n- `longitude`: User longitude\n\n**Headers:**\n- `X-localization`: Language (ar or en)\n\n**Response includes:**\n- `zone_id`: Detected zone ID(s)\n- Zone information"
